That's off-topic but... actually for exporting triangular matrices, no need to use cat:

toto=dist(1:5)
M <- as.matrix(toto)
M[upper.tri(M)] <- ""
write.table(M, file="M.txt")

There may be a need for adding an extra space at the begining of the file for some software.

Cheers

Thibaut.



